# Pairs with NoPhantomAudit. The caller infers its own change from the anchor
# having moved since its base read, so a removal that matched nothing, while a
# replicated or concurrent write moved the anchor, is recorded as committed.
MODULE: AuditAnchorMovedClaimsCommitted
TARGET: NoPhantomAudit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a call that wrote nothing is committed whenever the anchor moved
PERTURBS: Finalize

--- FIND
                     [] op[o].changed -> "Committed"
--- REPLACE
                     [] op[o].changed \/ Obs # op[o].base -> "Committed"
--- END
